1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 4=

8
00:00:47,259 --> 00:00:48,259
Are you sure?

9
00:00:48,659 --> 00:00:49,659
No regrets?

10
00:00:51,179 --> 00:00:52,179
Dong,

11
00:00:52,619 --> 00:00:54,420
I'm still inexperienced.

12
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:58,939
I'm afraid I can't handle
your passionate advances.

13
00:00:59,799 --> 00:01:02,579
Please be gentle with me.

14
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:06,680
Don't overthink it.

15
00:01:07,299 --> 00:01:08,539
Dual cultivation is a practice.

16
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:09,900
I'll guide you.

17
00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:04,260
(Darn it.)

18
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:07,019
(I was defiled by a lowlife scoundrel.)

19
00:02:07,859 --> 00:02:10,479
(I'll have him hacked to pieces.)

20
00:03:08,099 --> 00:03:10,139
(This villain is forcing himself
on Su Wan'er.)

21
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,460
(I must leave this place at once.)

22
00:03:23,340 --> 00:03:24,680
(The world is yin and yang.)

23
00:03:25,539 --> 00:03:26,900
(The earth nurtures all beings.)

24
00:03:27,979 --> 00:03:29,319
(Gather qi into the dantian.)

25
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,979
(Refine qi into pure tranquility.)

26
00:03:53,030 --> 00:03:58,053
♪Parting clouds
to pluck the waxing moon♪

27
00:03:58,797 --> 00:04:03,339
♪Brewing a pot of bygone years♪

28
00:04:04,851 --> 00:04:10,062
♪Chill flame, window shade,
console my grieving soul♪

29
00:04:10,761 --> 00:04:15,239
♪Drunk through lifetimes
with no dreams returned♪

30
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:20,779
♪If not for letting go, how could I
bear to shatter this dream♪

31
00:04:20,779 --> 00:04:21,899
Dual cultivation path,

32
00:04:22,540 --> 00:04:25,160
help me reach
the Divine Transformation stage now.

33
00:04:27,936 --> 00:04:34,224
♪Like her, like yesterday,
like a carved flower hairpin♪

34
00:04:34,660 --> 00:04:35,920
Divine Transformation achieved.

35
00:04:39,776 --> 00:04:46,030
♪Like vows, like regret, like love,
we love to hurt, and we meet too late♪

36
00:04:46,030 --> 00:04:51,338
♪Tell me, after all this entanglement,
who regrets it more♪

37
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:05,040
(I hope Zishu sees the signal)

38
00:05:05,379 --> 00:05:06,699
(and comes to my rescue in time.)

39
00:05:08,319 --> 00:05:09,319
Youngest,

40
00:05:09,319 --> 00:05:11,600
where are you going at this late hour?

41
00:05:12,300 --> 00:05:13,300
I...

42
00:05:14,839 --> 00:05:16,120
I'm just getting some fresh air.

43
00:05:18,899 --> 00:05:19,899
(What's going on?)

44
00:05:20,379 --> 00:05:21,639
(I'm the ruler of a nation.)

45
00:05:21,939 --> 00:05:23,779
(I don't flinch
even when the sky falls.)

46
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:26,279
(Yet my heart races when I face him.)

47
00:05:27,839 --> 00:05:28,839
I told you,

48
00:05:28,860 --> 00:05:30,439
I'll protect you all for a lifetime.

49
00:05:30,839 --> 00:05:31,839
I won't hurt you.

50
00:05:31,839 --> 00:05:34,060
Don't be afraid. It's not safe outside.

51
00:05:34,199 --> 00:05:35,199
Come home with me.

52
00:05:35,399 --> 00:05:37,540
(This scoundrel is a real actor.)

53
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,759
Zishu pays respects to Your Majesty.

54
00:05:45,759 --> 00:05:46,759
No need for formalities.

55
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:47,920
Seize this villain at once.

56
00:05:57,379 --> 00:05:59,819
Zishu, what are you doing?

57
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:00,920
I'm sorry.

58
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:03,439
The truth is, I've always
been loyal to Lord Duan.

59
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,500
Your Majesty, if you hand over
the Imperial Seal,

60
00:06:06,740 --> 00:06:07,759
he will spare your life.

61
00:06:07,839 --> 00:06:09,079
I treated you like a sister.

62
00:06:09,500 --> 00:06:10,500
Yet you betray me.

63
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,360
You want the Imperial Seal?

64
00:06:12,519 --> 00:06:14,120
In your dreams. Go ahead.

65
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,120
Lord Duan won't kill you.

66
00:06:15,579 --> 00:06:17,660
Cooperate, and you'll avoid suffering.

67
00:06:17,860 --> 00:06:18,860
Take her away.

68
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,259
You're taking my wife away?

69
00:06:22,899 --> 00:06:24,220
Did you ask me?

70
00:06:25,180 --> 00:06:26,819
You survived my sword strike?

71
00:06:27,259 --> 00:06:28,459
Haven't you heard?

72
00:06:28,819 --> 00:06:30,060
Good people die young.

73
00:06:30,379 --> 00:06:31,379
But scoundrels live on.

74
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:34,360
That's exactly me.

75
00:06:34,779 --> 00:06:35,800
Who exactly are you?

76
00:06:36,220 --> 00:06:38,360
I told you, I'm her husband.

77
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,360
Nonsense.

78
00:06:39,519 --> 00:06:40,720
Do you know who she is?

79
00:06:40,939 --> 00:06:42,279
Of course I know.

80
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,040
She's my wife.

81
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,360
We have it in writing.

82
00:06:45,860 --> 00:06:47,439
(This villain is not only despicable)

83
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:48,439
(but also a bit stupid.)

84
00:06:48,699 --> 00:06:50,300
(And now he's still running his mouth.)

85
00:06:50,699 --> 00:06:51,720
(He is totally clueless.)

86
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,379
If you knew her true identity,

87
00:06:54,980 --> 00:06:56,959
you'd be shocked. She is...

88
00:06:56,959 --> 00:06:58,420
I don't care who she is.

89
00:06:58,839 --> 00:06:59,839
Whether she's a noble

90
00:06:59,839 --> 00:07:00,839
or a beggar,

91
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:03,000
she's my wife now.

92
00:07:03,220 --> 00:07:05,959
And I won't let anyone bully her.

93
00:07:06,848 --> 00:07:08,759
(Affection)
My dear, let's go home.

94
00:07:09,300 --> 00:07:10,300
How arrogant!

95
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:12,480
You dare to disrespect me?

96
00:07:12,899 --> 00:07:15,759
I'll kill you with my ultimate move,
the God-Slaying Slash.

97
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,720
What's going on?

98
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:45,800
What do you think?

99
00:07:46,459 --> 00:07:49,819
They were killed by my charm, of course.

100
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:54,600
(There's still a hidden master lurking?)

101
00:08:05,579 --> 00:08:07,579
Babe, you go back first.

102
00:08:08,139 --> 00:08:09,139
What...

103
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:11,500
What did you call me?

104
00:08:12,319 --> 00:08:13,319
Babe.

105
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,240
Calm down.

106
00:08:16,439 --> 00:08:17,439
You'll get used to it.

107
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:18,540
Go back and rest first.

108
00:08:18,939 --> 00:08:20,040
I'll check their bodies

109
00:08:20,579 --> 00:08:21,839
and see if there are valuables.

110
00:08:26,899 --> 00:08:28,939
(Now even Zishu has betrayed me.)

111
00:08:29,699 --> 00:08:31,199
(Who else can I rely on?)

112
00:08:32,100 --> 00:08:33,940
(Is this the end of my Chu clan?)

113
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:55,271
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

114
00:08:55,271 --> 00:08:58,058
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

115
00:08:58,634 --> 00:09:00,796
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

116
00:09:00,796 --> 00:09:03,642
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

117
00:09:03,642 --> 00:09:06,920
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

118
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:08,554
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

119
00:09:08,554 --> 00:09:10,618
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

120
00:09:10,618 --> 00:09:12,154
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

121
00:09:12,154 --> 00:09:14,936
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

122
00:09:15,385 --> 00:09:17,290
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

123
00:09:17,290 --> 00:09:23,321
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

124
00:09:23,903 --> 00:09:27,786
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

125
00:09:27,786 --> 00:09:31,011
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

126
00:09:31,523 --> 00:09:34,122
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

127
00:09:34,122 --> 00:09:39,250
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

128
00:09:39,250 --> 00:09:42,778
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

129
00:09:42,778 --> 00:09:46,486
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

130
00:09:46,486 --> 00:09:48,378
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

131
00:09:48,378 --> 00:09:50,455
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

132
00:09:50,455 --> 00:09:52,986
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

133
00:09:52,986 --> 00:09:57,023
♪You met the most precious person♪

134
00:09:58,691 --> 00:10:00,554
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

135
00:10:00,554 --> 00:10:03,073
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

136
00:10:03,073 --> 00:10:04,522
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

137
00:10:04,522 --> 00:10:06,824
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

138
00:10:06,824 --> 00:10:08,794
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

139
00:10:08,794 --> 00:10:13,204
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

140
00:10:13,204 --> 00:10:14,746
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

141
00:10:14,746 --> 00:10:16,656
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

142
00:10:16,656 --> 00:10:19,930
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

143
00:10:19,930 --> 00:10:23,251
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

144
00:10:23,251 --> 00:10:24,986
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

145
00:10:24,986 --> 00:10:29,610
♪Just catch your breath first♪

146
00:10:29,610 --> 00:10:33,360
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

147
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:36,738
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

148
00:10:37,112 --> 00:10:39,082
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

149
00:10:39,082 --> 00:10:44,829
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

150
00:10:44,829 --> 00:10:48,345
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

151
00:10:48,345 --> 00:10:49,914
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

152
00:10:49,914 --> 00:10:52,224
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

153
00:10:52,224 --> 00:10:53,962
♪From laughter to devotion♪

154
00:10:53,962 --> 00:10:56,018
♪From falling to innocence♪

155
00:10:56,018 --> 00:10:57,866
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

156
00:10:57,866 --> 00:11:04,536
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
